# Normalize every text file to LF, both in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of the developer's `core.autocrlf` setting. Windows Git installs
# commonly default to `autocrlf=true`, which rewrites checkouts to CRLF and made
# `bun fmt --check` fail on ~900 unrelated files (see #129).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never EOL-convert, diff or merge them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
